00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:40,900
A crowd gathered to watch Simpson,

227
00:19:41,140 --> 00:19:43,440
who pushed his Nomex race suit to the limit

228
00:19:43,441 --> 00:19:44,960
by covering it with gasoline.

229
00:19:46,340 --> 00:19:48,960
He strikes us, man, throws it at me, and poof.

