00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:34,020
With Thermoman dressed in cotton street clothes, the mannequin sensors produce computerized animation that shows the lethal potential of a flash fire.

247
00:21:34,780 --> 00:21:36,520
So I'm going to start this animation.

