00:22:38,781 --> 00:22:46,260
This dissipates the energy of the fire the same way energy is dispersed when a race car scatters into pieces during a wreck.

260
00:22:47,540 --> 00:22:55,260
Using Thermoman, researchers are able to break down the burn injury data and predict survivability according to the victim's age.

261
00:22:56,460 --> 00:23:03,680
So for the QC Nomex garment, survivability was pretty high for age 20 to 29.

262
00:23:03,900 --> 00:23:05,260
It was almost 100%.

